nto a complete wreck. An infected mind loses common sense. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/769970/extras/bdda5be5d45b3a833a5e3bd4983a5ade.poster.avif?t=1726349729\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/769970/extras/bdda5be5d45b3a833a5e3bd4983a5ade.webm?t=1726349729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/769970/extras/bdda5be5d45b3a833a5e3bd4983a5ade.mp4?t=1726349729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Attempt to save at least one person. Remember, sometimes 100% effort is still not enough. Don't let the fever infect your mind. Don't let the ink to change you...<br><br><strong>Game features:</strong><br><br>- The climate of a world resembling sleep during a fever.<br><br>- Creative riddles requiring an unconventional approach.<br><br>- Refined locations, full of intense, suggestive climate.<br><br>- A sincere and complex story told from the depth of the author's heart.",
